      "message": "ci(release): run the site tests in the site job\n\nPR #1825 added site/tests/test_operation_reference.py, which pins the\noperation reference pictures against OpType, but nothing ran it (nor the\nother Zola-building site tests). The site job of release.yml now runs\n`python3 -m unittest discover -s site/tests -v` with its pinned Zola\n(ZOLA=/tmp/zola), right after the Zola install and before version.toml\nis written, so a missing reference section or picture view fails the\nsite job. site/README.md says so.\n\nPinned by xtask/tests/release_site_tests.rs:\nthe_site_job_runs_the_site_tests_with_its_pinned_zola.\n\nFixes #1832\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
